County optional tax on solar energy
HB0305
production.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Lien and Campbell, K and Senator(s)
Pearson
AN ACT relating to taxation; authorizing a county to impose a tax on the
production of electricity from solar resources; providing for administration
and imposition of the tax; providing exemptions; providing for distribution of
the tax; and providing for an effective date.
